  "operation_ledger_version": 1,
  "scope": "Complete AWS CloudTrail API action inventory from the official Actions page. 19 ETL/read streams, 8 typed direct-read commands, and 30 typed reverse-ETL write/admin actions are executable through the connector-local native runtime using fixed action mappings, closed per-operation request schemas, resource discovery/fan-out for stream identifiers, and provider-supported idempotency for destructive writes. Only 3 actions remain blocked: StartQuery, CreateDashboard, and UpdateDashboard, each because their request body requires an unrestricted CloudTrail Lake SQL QueryStatement, which this repository disables for every connector by policy (capabilities.query is fixed false repo-wide; no raw SQL passthrough is ever exposed). Event record fields remain payload schema evidence, not CDC operations.",
